# Build context for the image: api/ and web/, and Orbit's guides (docs/*.md
# and the changelog, built into the binary for the docs page). The lab stays
# out.
.git
.gitignore
**/node_modules
web/dist
web/test-results
api/tmp
api/internal/webui/dist/*
!api/internal/webui/dist/index.html
*.db
*.sqlite
**/.env
lab
*.md
!docs/*.md
!CHANGELOG.md
# Design handoffs (reference only; not built into the image)
docs/design
